&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Blog writing&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SEO content creation&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Website content management&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Among all, IT internships are the most in-demand, as they directly connect students to the tech industry.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Paid vs Unpaid Internship&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Students often get confused between paid and unpaid internships.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Paid Internship&lt;/p&gt;

