&lt;p&gt;Structured work environment&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Unpaid Internship&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Focus on learning&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Flexible&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Better for beginners&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;👉 If you're starting out, focus on skills first, money later.&lt;/p&gt;

