&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎥 &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z3FoZ4r_WY8" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Simon Grimm - How to Build Smart TV Apps with React Native (Vega OS Guide)&lt;/a&gt;
